HTTP 429 from the gateway:
    rate limited=True session refused=False -> keep the token, it authenticated
XTS rate limit code:
    rate limited=True session refused=False -> keep the token, it authenticated
XTS missing or expired token:
    rate limited=False session refused=True -> log in again
HTTP 401:
    rate limited=False session refused=True -> log in again
HTTP 502 gateway page:
    rate limited=False session refused=False -> keep the token, the error says nothing about it
dropped connection:
    rate limited=False session refused=False -> keep the token, the error says nothing about it
